= A Microtool for Rapid Climate Risk Signal Estimation
== Abstract
We present a reproducible pipeline for generating coarse climate risk scores from small proxy datasets and scenario parameters. Results are intended for educational and exploratory decision support only.

== Method
Compute composite risk score from normalized hazard proxies with sensitivity analysis.

== Experiments
We run a CPU-only benchmark with fixed seed and report accuracy.

== Limitations
Small synthetic/curated data and simplified metrics reduce external validity.

== Ethical Considerations
The tool is intended for decision support; human oversight is required.
